 style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This hammer is well-worn and appears to have been used in the past to exterminate pests aboard pirate vessels. It's a surprisingly strong weapon for such a mundane task and would probably be useful in battle as well.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/page/Item:Ratkiller\" title=\"Item:Ratkiller\">Ratkiller</a> - Full table of the Ratkiller line.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817205340\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.117 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.185 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6067/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47137/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18426/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  158.100      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  158.100      1 -total\n 99.26%  156.936     79 Template:IO\n 97.76%  154.555      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 34.05%   53.826      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 33.06%   52.269      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 31.72%   50.142      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 30.47%   48.179      2 Template:InCategory\n 25.78%   40.761     17 Template:Popup\n 12.26%   19.386      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:13953-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817205340 and revision id 630305. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
